<div>- এলপি গ্যাসের পূর্ণরূপ: Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG)<br /><br /></div>
<div>Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), also called LP gas, any of several liquid mixtures of the volatile hydrocarbons <strong>propene, propane, butene, and butane</strong>. It was used as early as 1860 for a portable fuel source, and its production and consumption for both domestic and industrial use have expanded ever since.&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;<br />উৎস: প্রথম আলো, ব্রিটানিকা</div>
